  "description": "CR 603.4 / 508.5a / 702.111b / 702.2b: Fear of the Dark's attack trigger has an intervening if read against the player it attacks, so it gains menace and deathtouch attacking a player with no Glimmer creature and does not trigger attacking one who controls one",
